 "remarks": "Welcome to 145 Weed Street, a meticulously maintained Colonial offering a flexible floor plan, four finished levels and a convenient location just minutes from the heart of New Canaan. Built in 1995, this 4-bedroom, 3-bath home combines spacious, light-filled living with the benefits of newer construction and thoughtfully updated mechanical systems.  The dramatic living room features soaring ceilings and an abundance of natural light, creating a bright and inviting space. The kitchen offers recently upgraded stainless steel appliances, a propane range and generous cabinet storage, with direct access to a large deck ideal for dining al fresco and entertaining. The deck overlooks the fully fenced backyard, providing a private and versatile outdoor setting.  Four finished levels allow the home to adapt easily to a variety of needs, including a finished lower-level recreation room. Originally designed with a three-car garage, one bay has been thoughtfully converted into a spacious mudroom area, adding everyday convenience while retaining two garage bays.  Pride of ownership is evident throughout, with significant recent improvements including a new boiler and electrical panel in 2023, two new HVAC condensers in 2022 and a repaved driveway in 2024. With its 1995 construction, refreshed major systems and south-of-town location offering convenient access for commuters while remaining just minutes from downtown New Canaan.",
